WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:06.270
Masara Town, Kanto Region

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.090
I... choose you!

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:52.440
Satoshi!

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:56.410
You're <i>still</i> asleep?
You'll be late to Okido Laboratory!

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:59.990
Okido... Laboratory...

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:06.500
Mom! Why didn't you
wake me sooner?!

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:09.040
You said you could get up
on your own, didn't you?

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:12.130
See ya later!

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:20.100
This young man is
Satoshi from Masara Town.

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:24.680
He battles and catches Pokémon
together with his partner, Pikachu.

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:28.100
His Pokémon Trainer studies continue.

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:32.610
Professor Okido!

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:34.900
Oh, Satoshi!

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:37.030
What did you want me to do?

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:42.830
You see, this young professor I know
is opening a new laboratory in Kuchiba City today.

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:44.830
A new laboratory?

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:49.710
That's right. So I figured I'd invite you
to its opening ceremony.

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:51.590
You <i>are</i> going, I take it?

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:54.170
Yeah! And you, too, Pikachu!

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:55.090
"Of course!"

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:00.640
Mom?!

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:05.890
I just came to bring your lunch,
but what a great thing I just heard!

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:10.650
There are plenty of delicious sweets
and stylish shops in Kuchiba City!

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:13.270
W-Wait, you're coming too?

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:15.530
Let's go, right now!

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:25.790
Digda!

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:31.540
Butterfree!

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:35.800
Ever the Pokémon-lover, I see.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:39.550
Are you still working towards
becoming a Pokémon Master?

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:41.220
Yeah! Of course!

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:46.220
I'm definitely gonna be a Pokémon Master
together with this guy!

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:56.530
Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:59.110
You all packed and ready to leave?

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:01.820
I'll show you this wide mysterious world

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:04.700
And skip the slow send-off

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.040
Be it through fire or through water

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:09.710
I'm fumbling blindly through the days

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:14.210
When I don't even know what the next second will bring

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:19.470
Each and every one of my memories

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:24.050
Can always be found inside a Ball

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.970
On 1, 2, 3, dive in!

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:33.730
I've got the future plans I imagined in my pocket

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:40.740
Greeting someone new is always fresh

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:44.820
No need (No need!) to hesitate! Try! (Try!)

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.280
Let's have a fight!

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:48.990
1: Once the battle's done

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:50.830
2: And we're laughing or crying

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:55.170
On 3, let's be friends!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:04:01.840
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:07.180
With this unpredictable, boundless world awaiting

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:09.680
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:13.810
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:15.480
I choose you!

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:24.490
Aboard Lugia They Go!
Satoshi and Go,
Aboard Lugia They Go!
Satoshi and Go,

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:27.490
Kuchiba City, Kanto Region

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:32.000
Here we are.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.250
I'll park the car,
so you just go on ahead.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.250
Sure!

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.810
It's a Pokémon I've never
seen before!

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:53.770
You're so cute!
Where are you from?

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:55.810
What's your name?

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:59.400
Lemme touch you just a little!

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:00.900
C'mon?

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.650
Caught you!

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:23.010
All right,
see you tomorrow!

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:24.630
Bye bye!

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:31.600
Wanpachi! I'm home!

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:41.940
Satoshi.

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:45.610
You'd better hurry,
or you'll miss the opening ceremony.

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.240
Got it!

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:00.710
Thank you for being so patient.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:04.920
My name is Sakuragi, and I am the chief here
at Sakuragi Laboratories, which is opening today.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:09.550
I am most grateful to see so many of you
come here from so far away.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:14.140
Now, then... Pocket Monsters,
or Pokémon for short.

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:21.270
As you all know, they are the strange, strange creatures
that live on this planet.

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:25.030
In the forests, in the skies,
in the seas...

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:29.660
You can find them
all over the world.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:35.660
Humans and Pokémon live together in this world,
forming diverse kinds of bonds.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.080
Here at Sakuragi Laboratories,

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:42.670
we wish to observe and analyze
everything about these mysterious Pokémon,

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:46.420
so that we may deepen
our understanding of them.

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:50.180
To know Pokémon is
to know the world.

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:55.310
I believe this will help
make the world a better place!

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:20.330
That Go...

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:26.550
I brought the school handouts
because he said he'd be here today...

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:37.100
"I'm about to have
a fateful encounter, so I'll be late"?!

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:40.230
Sheesh...

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:43.480
His messages are <i>always</i> like this.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:56.740
Just as I predicted...

00:07:56.740 --> 00:08:00.580
Those clouds make it look like
<i>it</i> could appear at any moment!

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.080
This'll be easy!

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.050
What is this?

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:21.230
From this air flow, temperature,
humidity and altitude...

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:24.560
This is just
my prediction, but...

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:30.610
In roughly 20 minutes, an exceedingly rare Pokémon
will appear at Kuchiba Port!

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:32.610
A rare Pokémon?!

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:35.320
What do you think?

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.910
It does seem pretty big...

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:37.870
Professors!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:39.790
I'll go have a look!

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:43.410
What if it's
a Legendary Pokémon?!

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:58.760
All right! I'm first!

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:08.610
Kabigon?!

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:11.230
Please, move!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.320
Here it comes!

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:18.910
Five...

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:19.870
Four...

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:20.910
Three...

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:22.040
Two...

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:23.000
One...

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.200
Go!

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:31.840
Huh? That's strange...

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.800
W-What?!

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.230
Over there?!

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:05.870
There it is!

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:06.790
It's Lugia!

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.420
It was well worth the wait!

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:13.630
Kameil! Ice Beam!

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:14.840
Thunders! Thunder!

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.300
Gänger! Night Head!

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:36.740
Wait for me, Lugia!

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:45.790
All right!
Let's fight it together!

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:46.750
It's a Raid Battle!

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:48.500
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:55.800
Yamirami! Evil Pulse!

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:57.170
Usokki! Rock Slide!

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:58.670
Gaburias! Dragon Claw!

00:10:58.670 --> 00:10:59.930
Kirikizan! Crossroad Kill!

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.760
Armorgaw! Steel Wing!

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.030
Found you!

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:25.620
Lugia...

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.040
Let's battle!

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:38.170
Pikachu!
Use 100,000 Volts!

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:55.440
Pikachu!

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:00.490
Wait!

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:03.320
The future lies in my hands!

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:07.120
Lugia!

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:16.000
Gonna fall!

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:20.380
Who are you?!

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:33.480
Pocket Monsters!

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:41.490
.Psychic.
Flying
Lugia

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.130
Lugia...

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:05.010
Amazing!
I'm riding on Lugia?!

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:14.430
So this is how it moves its fins...

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:15.810
And...

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:19.520
Its skin is rougher
than I thought it'd be.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:20.860
But...

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.320
It's really warm!

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:28.240
Well, of course!
It's Lugia, after all!

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:45.380
Onidrill!

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.890
Onidrill flying at
the same height as Lugia...

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:54.600
They're really strong flyers!

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:12.280
We're gonna crash!

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:34.390
<i>Here we go!</i>

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:17.560
That was close...

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:18.680
But, you know...

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:22.440
Meeting so many different Pokémon
is the best!

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.520
You're quite the character!

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:27.980
What, really?

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:29.650
I accept!

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:30.530
Accept what?

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:32.450
Accept you as my friend!

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:34.200
What's that about?

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:37.080
I'm Go from Kuchiba City!

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:39.870
I'm Satoshi from Masara Town!

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.870
This is my partner, Pikachu!

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.500
It's nice to meet you!

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.240
You all right?

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:11.570
Yeah...

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:25.000
Thank you, Lugia!
Let's meet again!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:27.090
Later!
Thank you, Lugia!
Let's meet again!

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:33.800
It's gone...

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.060
Pokémon sure are nice.

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:46.600
Yeah.

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:49.440
Lugia reminded me...

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.820
...just how big the world is.

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:58.780
And that if you just want it bad enough,
you can go anywhere...

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:00.830
...and meet whatever
Pokémon you want!

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:03.200
Yeah, of course you can!

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.910
You can meet them, for sure!

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:17.090
Well, I guess it's time to go back.

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:19.930
But where...

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:22.680
...<i>are we?!</i>

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:31.070
We finally... made it...

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.200
Go, you're late!

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:41.200
Listen to this, Koharu!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:44.200
We just had a fateful encounter...

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:47.080
...with Lugia! We met Lugia!

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.580
Did you now...

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:52.550
Anyway, here's the
handouts from school.

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:55.420
Oh, sure...

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:57.130
Not that I really need them...

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:00.640
Oh, by the way,
where's Chief Sakuragi?

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:03.060
Dad's inside with Professor Okido...

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:05.770
What?! Professor Okido is here?!

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:08.440
Professor!

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:13.980
Chief Sakuragi is your dad?

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:26.830
Nobody's ever caught footage of
Lugia's fins mid-flight this close up before!

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:29.040
That's not even
the biggest surprise!

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.170
Is this underwater?!

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.420
Amazing, Go!

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.260
How about you, Satoshi?

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:43.100
Lugia took a bit of a liking to us!

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:45.810
A liking?

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:48.850
What makes you say that?

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:52.270
I kinda felt a jolt
when I locked eyes with Lugia!

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:55.480
What's that supposed to mean?
Sure you didn't just imagine it?

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:56.990
I did <i>not!</i>

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:59.860
Um, how do I put it...

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:03.950
It's like an electric shock just
ran through me around this part...

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:10.790
Come to think of it, Lugia did lessen the impact
with a Hydro Pump for us, didn't it?

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:12.880
That's right! And when it
plunged into the water,

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:16.460
I heard a voice saying "Here we go!"

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:17.010
Huh?!

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.630
That's incredible, Satoshi!

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:19.590
Huh? What is?

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:24.600
Satoshi, and Go.

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:28.470
I'm profoundly grateful
for your initiative.

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:32.770
You've let me learn
unknown secrets about Lugia!

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:37.320
And so, I have a request for you.

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:40.610
Would you become research fellows
at my laboratory?

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:42.490
"Research fellows"?

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:45.030
It means special lab assistants.

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:52.210
I want you to meet, touch,
and speak to all the Pokémon of the world,

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:53.370
and then...

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:56.130
...we will deepen our
knowledge of Pokémon!

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:58.300
Together!

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:00.880
I had been waiting to hear that.

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:04.930
That is the new future
I should take in hand, yeah?

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:07.260
Chief Sakuragi! I'll do it!

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:10.390
Oh, you both accept?!

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:12.810
Sure! I won't lose
to Satoshi, though!

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:14.310
I won't lose to you, either!

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:14.730
No, <i>I</i> won't lose!

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:16.770
Are you sure, Satoshi?
No, <i>I</i> won't lose!

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:20.150
Commuting from Masara Town
to here will be tough.

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:23.030
If so...

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.750
Is this our own dorm?

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:36.670
All right! A dorm! A dorm!

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:38.750
I'll have the top bed!

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:39.630
Wait!

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:41.340
<i>I'll</i> sleep up top!

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:43.630
You probably toss and turn in your sleep,
so you get the bottom bed!

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:44.680
Right back at you!

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:46.720
I'll sleep on top since I'm taller!

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:49.060
No, <i>I'm</i> taller!

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:52.350
Well, in that case...

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:56.560
Bari, look after Satoshi
for me, okay?

00:20:58.650 --> 00:20:59.900
See you later, Mom.

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:00.980
Oh, that's right.

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:04.360
Make sure you eat properly.
That includes the vegetables.

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:06.360
Oh, and brush your teeth! And...

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:07.990
I got it...

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.240
Go, look after my son.

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:12.950
Leave it to me!

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:14.870
Oh, cut it out!

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.210
All right! See you soon!

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:19.590
I will be waiting for you,
Professor Okido!

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:25.880
Dad! Still not ready?

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:29.050
Oh, I'm so sorry!
Just wait a little longer!

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:32.140
There's one more
important thing I'd forgotten.

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:43.860
It's Hitokage, Fushigidane
and Zenigame!

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:49.370
I still hadn't given you your starter Pokémon
for your trainer début, had I?

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:51.700
So, who do you choose?

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:52.740
I...

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:55.750
I choose...

00:21:57.370 --> 00:21:58.500
...Mew!

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:03.340
I've decided that Mew
will be my first Pokémon!

00:22:03.340 --> 00:22:05.720
The Mythical Pokémon?!

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:13.060
<i>That</i> future already lies
in my hands, too, yeah?!

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:15.060
You really are
an interesting guy, Go.

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:17.140
Not as interesting
as you, though.

00:22:17.140 --> 00:22:18.440
Right! I win!

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:19.440
What?!

00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:21.310
In that case,
I'm more interesting!

00:22:21.310 --> 00:22:21.770
No, me!

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:23.320
Oh, who even cares?
No, me!

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:23.940
Oh, who even cares?

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:27.400
Then, I'll be waiting...

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:28.820
...to learn Mew's secrets!

00:22:28.820 --> 00:22:30.110
Yes, Sir!

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:35.990
A world of dreams and adventures
with Pocket Monsters awaits!

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:37.960
Let's go!

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:41.000
Pokémon Shiritori

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:44.000
Let's play Pokémon Shiritori!
Pokémon Shiritori

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:45.300
Pokémon Shiritori

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:46.630
Pikachu!

00:22:46.630 --> 00:22:47.380
Utsubot!

00:22:47.380 --> 00:22:48.220
Transel!

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:49.010
Lugia!

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:49.800
Achamo!

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:50.470
Morpeko!

00:22:50.470 --> 00:22:51.260
Koduck!

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:52.140
Klefki!

00:22:52.140 --> 00:22:52.800
Eevee!

